    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d886">

                <pb facs="0706" n="590" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg590"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/12990.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Brazilian Minister to
                        Mexico to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brazilian Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-25T01:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 25, 1914, 1 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>133. I conferred with Carranza in the sense of the Department’s August 22, 2
                    p.m., and finally convinced him of the necessity of <pb facs="0707" n="591"
                        xml:id="pg591"/> dealing with the Diplomatic Corps with due consideration;
                    and, to begin with, he promised to notify the Diplomatic Corps tomorrow of his
                    having taken possession of the Executive Power.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cardoso de Oliveira</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
